'''Frosty the Snow Blaster''' is an {{Epic}} item that can fire [[Snowball]]s for the [[Season of Jerry]] event. It can be obtained from {{NPCSprite|Sherry}}.

== Obtaining ==
'''Frosty the Snow Blaster''' can be purchased for {{c|75000}} by interacting with {{NPCSprite|Sherry}}. It is initially empty.

== Usage ==
The player can click or hold down right-click to shoot {{Item|Snowball}}s. The {{Item|Snowball}}s move at a faster rate than those shot by the {{Item|Frosty the Snow Cannon|text=Cannon}}.

'''Frosty the Snow Blaster''' has a capacity of {{Item|Snowball|amount=2000}}s. The ammo count is shown in the description and can be shown by left clicking while holding '''Frosty the Snow Blaster'''. The player can refill their ammo by interacting with {{NPCSprite|Frosty}} for {{c|1}} per {{Item|Snowball}} missing. If the player does not meet the {{c}} requirement, {{NPCSprite|Frosty}} will refill '''Frosty the Blaster''' based on the amount of {{c}} the player has.

If the player wears {{Item|Snow Suit Armor|text=Snow Suit}} or {{Item|Nutcracker Armor}}, '''Frosty the Snow Blaster''' gains infinite ammo.

A {{Mythic}} {{Item|Snowman Pet}} has a {{Green|50%}} chance to double damage done by {{Item|Snowball}}s.

